\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=2cm]
    \item Understand the historical development and motivation for adaptive control
    \item Master the mathematical foundations of Model Reference Adaptive Control (MRAC)
    \item Derive adaptation laws using both gradient descent (MIT Rule) and Lyapunov methods
